    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Note: The game currently does not support controller operation.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Sweeper</strong> is a rogue-like game where players take on the role of a trooper tasked with defending a base from relentless waves of strange creatures. Players must rely on skill, speed, and smart strategy to survive and eliminate every threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the swarm, upgrade your weapons and abilities to become even deadlier.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special abilities and enhancing your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 type of guns those you can use for wiping out the swarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 5 dangerous levels in an abandoned space station.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 5 brutal bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arm yourself and choose a weapon that matches your playstyle and adapts to every challenge you face.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handgun:</strong> Basic gun with infinite ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun:</strong> Short range gun that can push enemies away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rifle:</strong>\u00a0Auto-aim medium range gun with high fire rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy machine gun:</strong>\u00a0No auto-aim medium gun with low fire rate but hit hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sniper:</strong> Auto-aim long range weapon that can kill everything in straight line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flamethrower:</strong>\u00a0Kill everything with fire around yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way through each level until you reach the escape pod.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Note: The game currently does not support controller operation.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Sweeper</strong> is a rogue-like game where players take on the role of a trooper tasked with defending a base from relentless waves of strange creatures. Players must rely on skill, speed, and smart strategy to survive and eliminate every threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the swarm, upgrade your weapons and abilities to become even deadlier.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special abilities and enhancing your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 type of guns those you can use for wiping out the swarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 5 dangerous levels in an abandoned space station.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 5 brutal bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arm yourself and choose a weapon that matches your playstyle and adapts to every challenge you face.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handgun:</strong> Basic gun with infinite ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun:</strong> Short range gun that can push enemies away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rifle:</strong>\u00a0Auto-aim medium range gun with high fire rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy machine gun:</strong>\u00a0No auto-aim medium gun with low fire rate but hit hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sniper:</strong> Auto-aim long range weapon that can kill everything in straight line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flamethrower:</strong>\u00a0Kill everything with fire around yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way through each level until you reach the escape pod.</h2>",
